        array('Ooty and Coonoor', '<p>Ooty is the classic Nilgiri hill station: the lake, the botanical garden, Doddabetta peak and tea gardens. Coonoor is quieter. The Nilgiri Mountain Railway toy train is a highlight; tickets are limited, so book early.</p>'),
