        array('Lachung and Yumthang', '<p>From Gangtok, the drive to Lachung takes most of a day. The next morning you visit Yumthang Valley, the "valley of flowers", known for rhododendrons in spring, then return towards Gangtok. Our Darjeeling with Lachung and Gangtok tour includes this.</p>'),
